.DS_Store

# Run data is generated by the WDIO reporter, not committed. The seed files
# (history.json / latest.json) below are kept so the app never 404s on a fresh
# checkout; real runs overwrite them.
public/data/*.json
!public/data/history.json
!public/data/latest.json
